  site is served from the domain root). Do not prepend site.url here: absolute
  asset URLs break when the GitHub Pages hostname redirects to the custom domain.
  Use the relative_url filter for assets and the absolute_url filter when a full
  https:// URL is required (canonical, Open Graph, share links).
